## Next Steps

When you're satisfied with initial ML experimentation (e.g. validated that a model with reasonable performance can be trained on your dataset) and ready to deploy production training/inference pipelines, you can use the Databricks CLI bundles to deploy to your dev workspace and iterate.

CI/CD workflows (GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, or similar) are not currently included in this template and should be added separately based on your organization's requirements. You can reference the [MLOps Stacks README](https://github.com/databricks/mlops-stacks/blob/main/README.md) for examples of CI/CD integration patterns.
